Consider the following Java code:

```java
class A {
    public A() { System.out.print("A"); }
}

class B extends A {
    public B() { System.out.print("B"); }
}

public class Test {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new B();
    }
}
```
What will be the output when `Test` is executed?
